/E (The Cisco Certified Network Associate \(CCNA v1.1\) exam \(200-301\) is a globally recognized certification that validates essential networking skills, including network fundamentals, IP addressing, routing, switching, VLANs, wireless networking, network security, artificial intelligence and automation. It is designed for IT professionals, network engineers, and system administrators seeking to build expertise in Cisco networking technologies.)
